# This project has three independently-configured components. Each has its
# own .env.example with the variables relevant to it — copy those, not this
# file, when setting up a component:
#
#   backend/.env.example   — database URL, JWT secret, CORS origins, demo data
#   web/.env.example       — the backend API base URL for the dashboard
#
# The Android app does not use a .env file; its backend URL is set at build
# time via a Gradle property (-PapiBaseUrl=...) — see android/README.md.
#
# This root file exists only as a pointer for anyone browsing the repo root.
